  "why_this_file_exists": "Metricool's analytics API only serves a rolling ~14-day window (verified 2026-08-03: a request for June returns 0 rows and the earliest available row is 2026-07-20). This experiment published 2026-07-26..29, so its raw metrics leave the API around 2026-08-09 and the read becomes impossible. Metricool's SCHEDULER retention is shorter still: 21 of the 41 posts had already dropped off /v2/scheduler/posts by 2026-08-03, which is what broke the uuid->permalink join the dashboard depends on. This file is the durable copy.",
