    "arm_labels": "/home/ec2-user/hermes-data/metricool-scheduled.json (written by ops/resume_posting.mjs, frozen since 2026-07-28)",
    "metrics": "Metricool /v2/analytics/reels/instagram via hermes-nous/bridge/metricool-read.ts (read-only)",
    "join_uuid": "ledger.uuid -> scheduler post -> providers[].publicUrl -> analytics.url",
    "join_timestamp": "For the 21 posts whose scheduler record had expired, the arm label was re-attached by publish-time. The offset law was VALIDATED, not assumed: all 20 uuid-verified pairs sit at +7.0153..+7.0692h (mean 7.0383, sd 0.0123) between the ledger's Central-naive 'at' and the analytics' Madrid-naive publishedAt, which is exactly the Europe/Madrid - America/Chicago offset. Matching used +/-7 min and a strict 1:1 assignment; all 21 matched with no leftovers on either side.",
    "join_caveat": "Two motion-hook posts 5 minutes apart (2026-07-27-r04 / -r08) are mutually swappable. Both carry the SAME arm, so the swap cannot affect any arm-level statistic."
  },
